-- Regulation W, 12 CFR 223.41 and 223.16(c): exemptions from the quantitative limits and the collateral requirements.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
-- Each exemption is a predicate on facts stated to it: whether the conditions of the text are met.
-- A determination, approval or notice is a stated fact; what the exemption leaves in force is in regwb-effects.l4.

IMPORT prelude

§ `223.41(a) and (b): transactions with a depository institution`

-- (a): "Transactions with a depository institution if the member bank controls 80 percent or more of the voting
-- securities of the depository institution or the depository institution controls 80 percent or more of the voting
-- securities of the member bank."
GIVEN
    isDepositoryInstitution IS A BOOLEAN
    bankHolds               IS A NUMBER
    institutionHolds        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.41(a)
`exempt as a parent or subsidiary institution` MEANS
    isDepositoryInstitution AND (bankHolds AT LEAST 80 OR institutionHolds AT LEAST 80)

-- (b): "Transactions with a depository institution if the same company controls 80 percent or more of the voting
-- securities of the member bank and the depository institution."
GIVEN
    isDepositoryInstitution IS A BOOLEAN
    companyHoldsOfBank      IS A NUMBER
    companyHoldsOfInstitution IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.41(b)
`exempt as an institution under the same holding company` MEANS
    isDepositoryInstitution AND companyHoldsOfBank AT LEAST 80 AND companyHoldsOfInstitution AT LEAST 80

§ `223.41(c): loan purchases from an affiliated depository institution`

-- (c): "Purchasing a loan on a nonrecourse basis from an affiliated depository institution."
GIVEN
    purchaseOfALoan              IS A BOOLEAN
    nonrecourse                  IS A BOOLEAN
    fromAnAffiliatedInstitution  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.41(c)
`exempt as a nonrecourse loan purchase` MEANS purchaseOfALoan AND nonrecourse AND fromAnAffiliatedInstitution

§ `223.41(d): internal corporate reorganization transactions`

-- (d): "Purchasing assets from an affiliate ..., if: (1) The asset purchase is part of an internal corporate
-- reorganization of a holding company and involves the transfer of all or substantially all of the shares or assets
-- of an affiliate or of a division or department of an affiliate; (2) The member bank provides its appropriate
-- Federal banking agency and the Board with written notice of the transaction before consummation ...; (3) The member
-- bank's top-tier holding company commits ... before consummation either: (i) To make quarterly cash contributions
-- ... for a two-year period ...; or (ii) To repurchase, on a quarterly basis for a two-year period ...; (4) The ...
-- holding company complies with the commitment made under paragraph (d)(3); (5) A majority of the member bank's
-- directors reviews and approves the transaction before consummation; (6) The value of the covered transaction
-- (as computed under this part), when aggregated with the value of any other covered transactions ... engaged in by the
-- member bank under this exemption during the preceding 12 calendar months, represents less than 10 percent of the
-- member bank's capital stock and surplus (or such higher amount, up to 25 percent ..., as may be permitted by the
-- member bank's appropriate Federal banking agency ...); and (7) The holding company and all its subsidiary member
-- banks and other subsidiary depository institutions are well capitalized and well managed and would remain well
-- capitalized upon consummation of the transaction."
-- `percentPermitted` is the percentage of capital stock and surplus the aggregate must stay under: 10, or the higher
-- amount, up to 25, the agency has permitted.
GIVEN
    purchaseOfAssetsFromAnAffiliate IS A BOOLEAN
    partOfInternalReorganization    IS A BOOLEAN
    transfersAllOrSubstantiallyAll  IS A BOOLEAN
    writtenNoticeBeforeConsummation IS A BOOLEAN
    holdingCompanyCommitted         IS A BOOLEAN
    holdingCompanyComplies          IS A BOOLEAN
    majorityOfDirectorsApproves     IS A BOOLEAN
    aggregateValue                  IS A NUMBER
    capitalStockAndSurplus          IS A NUMBER
    percentPermitted                IS A NUMBER
    wellCapitalizedAndWellManaged   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.41(d)
`exempt as an internal corporate reorganization` MEANS
        purchaseOfAssetsFromAnAffiliate
    AND partOfInternalReorganization
    AND transfersAllOrSubstantiallyAll
    AND writtenNoticeBeforeConsummation
    AND holdingCompanyCommitted
    AND holdingCompanyComplies
    AND majorityOfDirectorsApproves
    AND aggregateValue TIMES 100 LESS THAN capitalStockAndSurplus TIMES percentPermitted
    AND percentPermitted AT LEAST 10
    AND percentPermitted AT MOST 25
    AND wellCapitalizedAndWellManaged

§ `223.16(c): exemptions for transactions treated as with an affiliate`

-- (c)(2): "An affiliate's retention of a portion of the proceeds ... as a brokerage commission, agency fee, or riskless
-- principal mark-up, if that commission, fee, or mark-up is substantially the same as, or lower than, those prevailing
-- at the same time for comparable transactions with or involving other nonaffiliates, in accordance with the market
-- terms requirement of § 223.51."  Whether it is, is stated.
GIVEN
    retentionIsOfCommissionFeeOrMarkup IS A BOOLEAN
    onMarketTerms                      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.16(c)(2)
`exempt as a commission, fee or mark-up on market terms` MEANS retentionIsOfCommissionFeeOrMarkup AND onMarketTerms

-- (c)(1): "An extension of credit by a member bank to a nonaffiliate, if: (i) The proceeds of the extension of credit
-- are used to purchase a security through a securities affiliate of the member bank, and the securities affiliate is
-- acting exclusively as a riskless principal in the transaction; (ii) The security purchased by the nonaffiliate is not
-- issued, underwritten, or sold as principal (other than as riskless principal) by any affiliate of the member bank;
-- and (iii) Any riskless principal mark-up or other compensation received by the securities affiliate from the
-- proceeds of the extension of credit meets the market terms standard set forth in paragraph (c)(2)".
GIVEN
    extensionToANonaffiliate        IS A BOOLEAN
    securityBoughtThroughSecuritiesAffiliateAsRisklessPrincipal IS A BOOLEAN
    securityNotIssuedUnderwrittenOrSoldAsPrincipalByAnAffiliate IS A BOOLEAN
    compensationMeetsMarketTerms    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.16(c)(1)
`exempt as a riskless principal credit` MEANS
        extensionToANonaffiliate
    AND securityBoughtThroughSecuritiesAffiliateAsRisklessPrincipal
    AND securityNotIssuedUnderwrittenOrSoldAsPrincipalByAnAffiliate
    AND compensationMeetsMarketTerms

-- (c)(3): "An extension of credit by a member bank to a nonaffiliate, if: (i) The proceeds ... are used to purchase a
-- security from or through a securities affiliate of the member bank; and (ii) The extension of credit is made
-- pursuant to, and consistent with any conditions imposed in, a preexisting line of credit that was not established in
-- contemplation of the purchase of securities from or through an affiliate of the member bank."
GIVEN
    extensionToANonaffiliate                IS A BOOLEAN
    proceedsBuySecurityFromOrThroughASecuritiesAffiliate IS A BOOLEAN
    madeUnderAPreexistingLineConsistentWithItsConditions IS A BOOLEAN
    lineNotEstablishedInContemplationOfThePurchase       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.16(c)(3)
`exempt as a credit under a preexisting line` MEANS
        extensionToANonaffiliate
    AND proceedsBuySecurityFromOrThroughASecuritiesAffiliate
    AND madeUnderAPreexistingLineConsistentWithItsConditions
    AND lineNotEstablishedInContemplationOfThePurchase

-- (c)(4)(ii): a general purpose credit card is "a credit card issued by a member bank that is widely accepted by
-- merchants that are not affiliates of the member bank ..., if: (A) Less than 25 percent of the total value of
-- products and services purchased with the card by all cardholders are purchases ... from one or more affiliates ...;
-- (B) All affiliates of the member bank would be permissible for a financial holding company ... and the member bank
-- has no reason to believe that 25 percent or more ... are or would be purchases ... from ... affiliates; or (C) The
-- member bank presents information to the Board that demonstrates, to the Board's satisfaction, that less than 25
-- percent ... are and would be purchases ... from ... affiliates."
GIVEN
    widelyAcceptedByNonaffiliateMerchants IS A BOOLEAN
    percentBoughtFromAffiliates           IS A NUMBER
    allAffiliatesPermissibleForAFinancialHoldingCompany IS A BOOLEAN
    bankHasNoReasonToBelieveTwentyFivePercent           IS A BOOLEAN
    boardAcceptedAShowing                 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.16(c)(4)(ii)
`is a general purpose credit card` MEANS
        widelyAcceptedByNonaffiliateMerchants
    AND (    percentBoughtFromAffiliates LESS THAN 25
          OR (allAffiliatesPermissibleForAFinancialHoldingCompany AND bankHasNoReasonToBelieveTwentyFivePercent)
          OR boardAcceptedAShowing)

-- (c)(4)(i): "An extension of credit by a member bank to a nonaffiliate, if: (A) The proceeds ... are used by the
-- nonaffiliate to purchase a product or service from an affiliate of the member bank; and (B) The extension of credit
-- is made pursuant to, and consistent with any conditions imposed in, a general purpose credit card issued by the member
-- bank to the nonaffiliate."  (iii): a card that qualified three consecutive months and then ceases may be treated as
-- one for that month and three more; that grace period is stated.
GIVEN
    extensionToANonaffiliate         IS A BOOLEAN
    proceedsBuyFromAnAffiliate       IS A BOOLEAN
    underAGeneralPurposeCreditCard   IS A BOOLEAN
    cardQualifies                    IS A BOOLEAN
    withinTheGracePeriod             IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@ref 12 CFR 223.16(c)(4)
`exempt as a general purpose credit card transaction` MEANS
        extensionToANonaffiliate
    AND proceedsBuyFromAnAffiliate
    AND underAGeneralPurposeCreditCard
    AND (cardQualifies OR withinTheGracePeriod)
